--- INC40118934#symptom (901 chars)
Incident INC40118934: Beneficiaries Denied Service Connected Rating 0% From Member Profile
Affected service: eCoverage
Description: Expected vs actual behavior when checking eligibility in the Coverage web application via Member Profile. Beneficiaries reported as eligible in the Benefits Determination Service are receiving an ineligible result from Member Profile. Expected: GIVEN a qualified applicant with a Service-Connected Rating of 0% AND Service-Connected = TRUE, THEN eligible. Actual: same conditions return NOT eligible. A set of affected internal ParticipantIds is retained in the related ticket (withheld here due to PII).
Initial notes: Does not correlate to known gateway outages; would expect clustering around the mid-month network events otherwise. Devs still investigating. | Running down what BDS sees on their end and determining whether the affected records may be future-dated.

