--- INC39644027#symptom (1093 chars)
Incident INC39644027: Member DOB displaying incorrectly in EHR Chart View
Description: Application Impacted: EHR Chart View. Member date of birth is displaying incorrectly in the chart but appears correct in the identity source and clinical record of truth. Issue reported as leaving member demographic information in an inconsistent state across systems.
Initial notes: The member's Member Profile record has the wrong birthday being sent to the EHR. The value needs to match the identity source. Transfer reason: needs correction in Member Profile and verification that the identity feed value is also correct. | No attachments visible and we were only assigned this ticket yesterday. Member Profile is a proxy for anything other than address/email/phone (the only attributes we master), so we would not be storing or mastering DOB. At most we forward DOB from downstream partners in response to a demographic request. With no stored data and no member registry ID, we cannot query audit records. Given the age of the ticket and the lack of identifiers, there is nothing actionable to offer.

--- INC39644027#resolution (407 chars)
Incident INC39644027: Member DOB displaying incorrectly in EHR Chart View
Resolution code: Not Solved (Not Reproducible)
